  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation capabilities, separating sensor outcomes from motion commands. The main specification binds sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforcing conservative obstacle recovery and steady exploration. Helper states ensure recovery actions are one-shot and that full_rotate is used only as a last resort after repeated failures.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception and actuation to reflect open-loop motion and sensor-driven transitions.",
